<title>CHINA: Chevalier Const year net down 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Chevalier Const year net down 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.4     vs  13.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    23.85    vs  30.66</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,415.01 vs 1,372.51</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chevalier Construction Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 7</p>
<p>NOTE - Chevalier Construction is a building construction and civil engineering group.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is three H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs three cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
